I wouldn't say that {ri} rhymes with {xekri}, bacause {xekri} implies a=20
feminine rhyme and {facki ri}, {klami'e ri} both force a masculine rhyme.
And also, I doubt that {ri} may refer to more objects than the last sumti.=
=20
So {ro ri} in the first line would be "all of the one ring".
Yes, translating pronouns to Lojban is hard.

mu'o mi'e ianek

